        "valueString": "Denies chest pain, shortness of breath, orthopnoea, ankle swelling, focal neurological symptoms, falls, fever, night sweats, recent illness, nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, Kussmaul breathing, confusion, or symptoms of DKA/HHS. Bowels unchanged and appetite is okay."
